{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "I need to flag a logistics issue. My carrier call confirmed that the container seal number differs from the number on the shipping notice. I spoke with the broker this morning, and customs allows a conditional release only if the discrepancy is documented in a receiving exception record. I have confirmed this requirement but have not yet filed that exception record. So from a logistics standpoint, we are not yet clear to proceed with disposition — I need to get the receiving exception record filed to enable a conditional release."}
```

