{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF3", "text": "EHS here. I completed my combustible-dust review for this graphite shipment this morning. My review requires that this graphite powder be moved into grounded metal bins with lids before any production use. The ordinary raw-material rack is not approved for storing this powder. I have not yet posted the storage instruction, so from an EHS standpoint, my review is complete but the storage requirement is not yet documented and posted."}
```

